## Custom Domain (Optional)

If you wish to attach your own branded domain (e.g. `teamora.greathire.com` or `greathire.com`):
1. Go to [Vercel Project Settings > Domains](https://vercel.com/sravans-projects-d52b9dc4/greathire-teamora/settings/domains).
2. Enter your domain.
3. Point the DNS CNAME/A record as instructed by Vercel.
